<section class="sub-hero"><div class="sub-hero-ph" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.18"></div><div class="wrap sub-hero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">Solutions</li></ol></nav><p class="kicker">What we do</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Solutions for Minnesota Property Claims</h1><p class="lede">From a one-time estimate review to full appraisal panel representation and neutral umpire work, every Minnesota Insurance Appraiser solution centers on an accurate, defensible valuation of your loss.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-sky" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line light" href="/contact-us/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="row-cards" data-stagger><a class="row-card rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/appraisal-clause-help/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><span class="row-k"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/></svg> Solution 01</span><h2>Appraisal Clause Representation</h2><p>We act as your named appraiser when the appraisal provision in your Minnesota policy is invoked by either side.</p></span></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/home-insurance-appraisal/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/bungalow.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/bungalow-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/bungalow.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="684" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><span class="row-k"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 10.5L12 3l9 7.5V21a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-5v-7H9v7H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z"/></svg> Solution 02</span><h2>Homeowner Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for houses, townhomes and cabins when the insurer’s estimate won’t cover a real Minnesota repair.</p></span></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/commercial-hoa-appraisal/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/townhomes.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/townhomes-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/townhomes.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="678" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><span class="row-k"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M9 6h2M13 6h2M9 10h2M13 10h2M9 14h2M13 14h2M10 22v-4h4v4"/></svg> Solution 03</span><h2>Commercial, Townhome &amp; HOA Claims</h2><p>Appraisal for association, townhome and commercial property claims where many buildings and owners share one policy.</p></span></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/hail-roof-appraisal/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-aerial.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-aerial-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-aerial.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="845" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><span class="row-k"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 16.6A5 5 0 0 0 18 7h-1.3A8 8 0 1 0 4 15.3"/><path d="M8 19v1M8 14v1M16 19v1M16 14v1M12 21v1M12 16v1"/></svg> Solution 04</span><h2>Roof &amp; Hail Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for hail-damaged roofs, siding, gutters and soft metals across the Twin Cities and southern Minnesota.</p></span></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/tornado-derecho-wind-appraisal/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tornado-damage.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="681" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><span class="row-k"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M17.7 7.7A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 19.5 12H2M9.6 4.6A2 2 0 1 1 11 8H2M12.6 19.4A2 2 0 1 0 14 16H2"/></svg> Solution 05</span><h2>Tornado, Derecho &amp; Straight-Line Wind</h2><p>Appraisal for tornado, derecho and straight-line wind losses, from torn shingles to whole structures and fallen trees.</p></span></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/water-damage-appraisal/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/flooded-basement.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/flooded-basement-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/flooded-basement.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="795" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><span class="row-k"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 22a7 7 0 0 0 7-7c0-2-1-3.9-3-5.5s-3.5-4-4-6.5c-.5 2.5-2 4.9-4 6.5S5 13 5 15a7 7 0 0 0 7 7z"/></svg> Solution 06</span><h2>Water &amp; Burst-Pipe Claims</h2><p>Appraisal for sudden water losses such as burst pipes, appliance leaks and failed water heaters in Minnesota homes.</p></span></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/fire-smoke-appraisal/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/fire-damaged-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fire-damaged-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fire-damaged-roof.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="1000" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><span class="row-k"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.4-.5-2-1-3-1.1-2.1-.2-4 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0c0-1.2.4-2.3 1-3.4.4 1.4 1.4 2.4 2.5 2.4z"/></svg> Solution 07</span><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for fire, smoke and soot losses, including northern Minnesota wildfire smoke and contents cleaning disputes.</p></span></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/ice-dam-winter-damage-appraisal/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/icicles-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/icicles-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/icicles-roof.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="685" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><span class="row-k"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 2v20M4.9 6.5l14.2 11M4.9 17.5l14.2-11M9 3.5l3 2.5 3-2.5M9 20.5l3-2.5 3 2.5"/></svg> Solution 08</span><h2>Ice Dam, Snow Load &amp; Frozen Pipe Claims</h2><p>Appraisal for Minnesota’s signature winter losses: ice dams, interior leaks, snow-load collapse and frozen pipes.</p></span></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/claim-estimate-review/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-chart.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-chart-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-chart.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><span class="row-k"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h5"/></svg> Solution 09</span><h2>Insurance Estimate Review</h2><p>A line-by-line Xactimate review of your insurer’s estimate so you know where the gaps are before deciding next steps.</p></span></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/appraisal-umpire/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation-laptop.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-laptop-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation-laptop.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><span class="row-k"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3v18M7 21h10M5 7h14M5 7l-3 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 6 0zM19 7l-3 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 6 0z"/></svg> Solution 10</span><h2>Umpire &amp; Neutral Services</h2><p>Neutral umpire services for Minnesota property appraisals when the two party appraisers cannot agree on the amount.</p></span></a><a class="row-card rv" href="/appraisal-solutions/contents-personal-property-appraisal/"><span class="row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/living-room.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/living-room-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/living-room.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="row-b"><span class="row-k"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M21 8l-9-5-9 5v8l9 5 9-5z"/><path d="M3 8l9 5 9-5M12 13v8"/></svg> Solution 11</span><h2>Contents &amp; Personal Property Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for personal property losses, from furniture and clothing to tools, electronics and cabin gear.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap faq-split"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Where to start</p><h2>Most files begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the insurer’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. A review gives you that in days, and some disputes close right there.</p><a class="btn btn-navy" href="/appraisal-solutions/claim-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for just one part of the process?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Many clients start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle commercial and association claims?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes — houses, cabins, condos and townhomes, apartment buildings, retail, office, churches and HOA properties.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is hail the only peril you work on?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>No. We also handle wind, tornado and derecho, ice dam and snow load, water, fire and smoke, and contents claims.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-strip"><div class="wrap"><div class="cta-strip-in rv"><div><h2>Not sure the settlement adds up?</h2><p>Send us the insurer’s estimate and your photos. We’ll tell you what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-sky" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line light" href="/contact-us/">Send the estimate</a></div></div></div></section>
